<p>The Ability System library, <strong class="selflink">ability_h</strong>, contains general purpose functions dealing with the ability, talent and spell system including, but not limited to:
</p>
<ul><li> Calculating and Subtracting Ability Costs</li>
<li> Invoking and rerouting Spellscript events</li>
<li> Wrappers for dealing with Upkeep Effects applied by Abilities</li></ul>
